{"title": "Aegis of the Absolute (Condition)", "pageid": 30301, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_(Condition)", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Has tick type", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aegis of the Absolute Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Aegis of the Absolute</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>The Netherbrain is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all types of damage it took in the previous round until the start of its next turn. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: start of turn\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/TickingWithSource\" title=\"Status properties/TickingWithSource\">TickingWithSource</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Aegis_of_the_Absolute\">Sources of Aegis of the Absolute</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aegis_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Aegis of the Absolute\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Icon.webp/30px-Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Icon.webp/45px-Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Icon.webp/60px-Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aegis of the Absolute\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Icon.webp/30px-Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Aegis_of_the_Absolute_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Aegis_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Aegis of the Absolute\">Aegis of the Absolute</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714231346\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1216/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16298/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4333/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUn